@startuml
title EXTERNAL_V2 return - positive item-only / negative full refund
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
actor Buyer
actor Seller
actor Inspector
actor Admin
participant FastAPI as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Lifecycle worker" as Worker
Inspector -> API : final result / private inspection evidence
alt PASS or MINOR_ISSUE
  API -> DB : atomic result + certificate + availability +72h
  alt Buyer REJECT before result cutoff
    Buyer -> API : REJECT
    API -> DB : one actual Buyer decision
  else Silence at/after result cutoff
    Worker -> DB : SYSTEM result-timeout command / marker
    note right of Worker : No Buyer decision, dispatch or money created
  end
else FAKE or NOT_AS_DESCRIBED
  API -> DB : negative result / no qualifying certificate
end
Inspector -> API : carrier / tracking final dispatch
API -> DB : server-derived TO_SELLER / frozen return address
opt Trusted Admin demo return delivered event
  Admin -> API : DELIVERED event
  API -> DB : transport event only / no return receipt or refund
end
alt Actual owning Seller receives
  Seller -> API : confirm-return
else Scoped Admin exception
  Admin -> API : return-review with reason / same-case evidence
  Admin -> API : confirm-return with issued references and reason
end
API -> DB : commit actual recipient + RETURNED_TO_SELLER / HELD
 group Separate financial transaction
  API -> DB : one existing settlement service / original snapshots
  alt Positive reject or result timeout
    API -> DB : REFUND1200 + retained100/50 = held1350
  else Negative inspection result
    API -> DB : full REFUND1350 / retained0
  end
  alt Settlement failure
    API --> Buyer : actual return durable / refund pending
    Worker -> DB : bounded retry / same persisted policy and cause once
  else Settlement committed
    API -> DB : REFUNDED / Product CANCELLED / one terminal record
    API --> Buyer : refund reference and retained fees
  end
 end
note over API,DB
  Original Payment/Receipt unchanged; Seller payout/commission0.
  No extra return fee, double fee deduction, auto relist or refund review.
  No-ship / audited non-receipt / LEGACY_V1 keep full refunds.
end note
@enduml
